Quick start:
  wifi-connect '<ssid>' '<psk>'    join Wi-Fi (persist: SD badge/wifi.conf)
  vi FILE                          edit (busybox vi)
  cat /mnt/sd/README.txt           microSD auto-mount + persistence layout
  ssh                              key-only: ssh-ed25519 pubkey in SD
                                   badge/ssh/authorized_keys
  echo 150 > /sys/class/backlight/backlight/brightness    0..255 (boot: 76)
  echo heartbeat > /sys/class/leds/rgb:indicator-0/trigger frontpanel LEDs
  sensorpanel | ble_scan           demos; Fn+Esc = display sleep
Rootfs is read-only squashfs: write under /tmp (RAM) or /mnt/sd.
